title: Hedda
act: Survey
location: Inn
quest: recipe
when: $act == Act.Survey
when: $quest_recipe == QuestState.NotStarted
---
Hedda: Welcome to the Drowned Bell. Hedda Brune. You'll be the map maker the whole valley is talking about.
Hedda: The bell? It's at the bottom of the well in my cellar. Fell in a hundred years ago, and the inn kept the name.
Hedda: And while you're here, you haven't seen a little brass box, have you? My mother's recipe for the fair cake is in it.
Hedda: I had it in the cellar last autumn, and now I can't find it anywhere.
-> I will look for it.
    Hedda: Bless you. If it's anywhere, it's down there among the barrels.
    <<set $quest_recipe to QuestState.Active>>
-> I am here for the map.
    Hedda: Of course. Maps first, cakes after.
    <<set $quest_recipe to QuestState.Offered>>
<<quest_changed recipe>>
===

title: Hedda
act: All
location: Inn
quest: recipe
when: has_item("recipe")
when: $quest_recipe == QuestState.Active
---
Hedda: My mother's box! Where was it?
Hedda: Behind the barrels. Of course it was. I'll make the cake for the fair, and you'll have the first slice.
<<take recipe>>
<<set $quest_recipe to QuestState.Succeeded>>
<<quest_changed recipe>>
===

title: CellarStairs
act: All
location: Inn
scenario: The commission
when: not $cellar_allowed
---
// The dialogue goes on while the cellar loads: Hedda walks to the stairs, the cartographer goes down, and she calls
// after them from the inn above.
Hedda: That's my cellar. Nobody goes down there without me.
-> Could you show me the cellar? The old well is a landmark.
    Hedda: The well? Nobody has measured that since my grandfather. Come on, then.
    <<set $cellar_allowed to true>>
    <<walk Hedda CellarStairs>>
    <<go CellarStairs>>
    Hedda: Mind the third step! It moves.
    Hedda: And don't touch the wine.
-> Never mind.
===

title: Well
act: All
location: Cellar
quest: survey
---
<<if surveyed("well")>>
    The well is on your map. Far down, something gleams. The drowned bell, maybe.
<<else>>
    An old well in the middle of the cellar, older than the inn. You drop a line to measure it, and set it down.
    <<survey well>>
    <<detour SurveyCheck>>
<<endif>>
===

title: RecipeBox
act: All
location: Cellar
quest: recipe
when: not $recipe_found
---
<<if $quest_recipe == QuestState.Active or $quest_recipe == QuestState.Offered>>
    Behind the barrels, a little brass box. Inside, a card in faded ink. Hedda's mother's recipe.
    <<give recipe>>
    <<set $recipe_found to true>>
    <<if $quest_recipe == QuestState.Offered>>
        <<set $quest_recipe to QuestState.Active>>
        <<quest_changed recipe>>
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    A little brass box behind the barrels. It isn't yours.
<<endif>>
===

title: Hollyroot
act: All
location: Cellar
quest: herbs
when: not $hollyroot_taken
---
<<if $quest_herbs == QuestState.Active>>
    Hollyroot grows pale in the dark, between the stones of the wall. You cut a piece.
    <<give hollyroot>>
    <<set $hollyroot_taken to true>>
<<else>>
    Something pale grows between the stones of the wall.
<<endif>>
===
